        "created_at": "2020-11-10T19:20:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The (ULTIMATE) Chairman and his (ULTIMATE) Operative have designs for the newly activated Omnitron IV. Can parse, ACTION HERO!!! Stuntman, Omnitron-U, and Void Guard Idealist take out his goons before the robot takeover? Find out right now!</p>\n<p>Ultimate reminder: If ANY Underbosses are in the trash at the start of the villain turn, the Chairman flips. Also, at the start of the villain turn, he regains H hp. Flip side, x = H instead of the usual x = H-2, so thugs and his retaliation are owchy.<br>\nOperative is reduce damage dealt to the Chairman and Operative by 1 and she also regains H hp. Flip side, End of villain turn the chairman deals H-2 damage to highest HP hero.<br>\n<br>\nGood luck heroes!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:27.580Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
