        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Mint with Stuntman down and the others ~10 hp.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Spoilers below:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whoooo boy does Action Hero Stuntman do a lot of damage when he puts his mind to it. I think the Chairman dropped in round 2? It was super fast. After that was just whittling down the Operative until she keeled over as well, though she did take Stuntman with her.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nFirst card play is Rook city is mine! So the Environment starts with Conveyor Panels and Resource Recycler. From there, I managed to get both Jailbreaks out quickly. Probably is very reliant on the deck shuffles, so here's what I did. No play on Parse first turn, and power to kill the informant. From there, the Broker also went down, due to the drones that came out I believe. The Chairman's next turn plays Jailbreak #1.&nbsp;Parse played Syntactic Analysis on Stuntman, and somewhere in the mess of actions that followed was Jailbreak #2.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter that, Stuntman got as set up as possible to deal Area damage, as well as Retaliation damage. He managed to blow himself and the Chairman up with a few Hidden Mines + Retaliation + Retaliation to that retaliation, etc. Chairman went down super fast, but Stuntman was ~5 hp and didn't last much longer.</p>",
