        "id": 234128,
        "name": "walla151",
        "username": "walla151",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/f0a364/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-11-10T19:45:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near mint. I was able to get Idealist set up with 15 cards underneath and use that to take down Chairman first. Omni with ablative helps against Operative punishment. Pay attention to environment cards, as they can help finish off underbosses but can also get out of control. This was more fun than I feared it might be!</p>",
